{"version":1,"content":"<html><body>\n<p>名媛蔡天鳳命案被告鄺港智在庭上自爆潛逃期間結識新女友Ivy，女方身份隨即被網民極速起底。有網民在社交平台直指藝人莊思敏與該名女子外貌極為相似，更直接向本尊貼出對比照挑機。</p>\n<h2>莊思敏社交平台發文 惹網民貼合照直指撞樣</h2>\n<p>昨日莊思敏於社交平台Threads上發文，邀請大眾列舉「common sense is not common」事件。未料帖文隨即引來大批網民偏離主題留言，當中有人突然貼出名媛蔡天鳳命案被告鄺港智與其前女友盧曉虹Ivy的合照。該名網民更直接標記莊思敏，並留言指「呀敏，你同Ivy好似樣！」，將兩人的外貌特徵進行對比。</p>\n<h2>藝人莊思敏親自回覆網民堅決否認外貌相似</h2>\n<p>面對網民突如其來的撞樣指控，莊思敏本人並沒有選擇視而不見，反而直接在該則留言下方親自作出回覆。她以簡短兩字「似咩？」反問對方，莊思敏的直接回應展現出她對雙方外貌相似這一說法毫不認同，更直接將網民的對比言論擋回，以行動劃清界線。</p>\n<h2>大批網民堅持二人外貌如同複製品激發熱烈討論</h2>\n<p>儘管莊思敏親自出面否認，但相關對比照依然在網上持續發酵，大批網民對其回應並不買帳。不少人在帖文下方繼續留言附和，紛紛表示「似」，更有人直指該名女子的外貌「比莊思明更加似姊妹」。部分網民進一步仔細比對兩人特徵，並留下「輪廓面形五官直頭係複製品」等強烈字眼，堅持認為兩人的面部特徵存在高度相似之處。</p>\n<h2>鄺港智前女友盧曉虹Ivy被揭露來自澳門 曾與霍哥拍片</h2>\n<p>觸發這次撞樣風波的核心人物盧曉虹，其真實背景亦被網民逐一揭露。據悉盧曉虹為澳門人，與蔡天鳳案另一女被告潘巧賢為相識多年的好友。網民更翻出一段塵封多年的影片，發現她早年曾與霍哥霍俊邦合作拍攝網上短片，在片中擔任空中吊環教練，其背景與活躍交友圈隨之曝光於大眾眼前。</p>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/177832268888079418_184561166269ff0d013a6ef.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"再婚莊思敏一原因拒簽字 網民質疑：怕再離婚？/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/177832268888079418_184561166269ff0d013a6ef.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：莊思敏IG）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179575537907453043_5152556966b090d7380fd5.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"蔡天鳳 鄺港智 （圖片來源：threads）\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179575537907453043_5152556966b090d7380fd5.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/177832268740764325_167202176469ff0cffb95c1.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"再婚莊思敏一原因拒簽字 網民質疑：怕再離婚？/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/177832268740764325_167202176469ff0cffb95c1.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：莊思敏IG）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179575538033147487_10204601226b090d74d715d.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"mdlguuzEbPO1uFS-OxDZanQTnm6bThn869SuM-vUrjM.jpeg/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/11/179575538033147487_10204601226b090d74d715d.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：threads）</figcaption></figure>\n<figure><a href=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/177832268674361771_121599589869ff0cfef39bf.jpg\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\"><img alt=\"再婚莊思敏一原因拒簽字 網民質疑：怕再離婚？/raw\" decoding=\"async\" height=\"484\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://imgs.weekendhk.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/05/177832268674361771_121599589869ff0cfef39bf.jpg\" width=\"960\"/></a><figcaption>（圖片來源：莊思敏IG）</figcaption></figure>\n<p>\n</p>\n<p>將來還有什麼演唱會值得留意？<i></i></p>\n<p>有不少歌手宣布舉辦演唱會，小編為你整合了<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/entertainment/hong-kong-concerts-2025-2402813/\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">香港演唱會2025一覽</a></b>，包含各演唱會優先購票日期、公開售票日期、門票價錢、座位表等，想搶飛粉絲必定要留意！</p>\n<p>香港有甚麼週末好去處推介？<i></i></p>\n<p>香港18區都非常值得花時間好好探索，一家大細去暢玩的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1217277/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1217277\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">親子好去處</a></b>、拍拖推介32大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1312748/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1312748\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">情侶好去處</a></b>、落雨必去的<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1128512/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1128512\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">室內好去處</a></b>、慶生推薦20大<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1363483/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1363483\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">生日好去處</a></b>、新手必備19大靚景<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1244714/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1244714\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">行山好去處</a></b>、秋天戶外<b><a href=\"https://www.weekendhk.com/1257443/?utm_source=faq&amp;utm_medium=organic&amp;utm_campaign=1257443\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" target=\"_blank\">露營好去處</a></b>…..</p>\n</body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-27T05:03:54.208944+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":1009,"images":5,"source":"WeekendHK","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-27T04:56:32+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-27T07:17:28.865568+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-27T04:57:26.188569+00:00","content_hash":"552f182c40c4eef0df5ed2550048209616c760334fcc106a6f86a3ed4787e46a","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}